    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX"   # add if the author has one
repository-code: "https://github.com/shahira15/drosies-world"
url: "https://drosiesworld.com"
abstract: >-
  Drosie's World is a free, browser-based collection of educational activities about the fruit fly
  Drosophila melanogaster and the scientific process. It includes a fruit fly genetics simulator,
  a laboratory-safety and microscope game, life-cycle activities, a simulated climbing assay,
  a lab-notebook practice module, a simulated scientific conference, a storybook reader and
  teacher resources. All experimental data are simulated. The software documents technical
  functionality only; no formal student learning outcomes have been established.
